      "context_id": "CTX_ENTROPY_LOSS",
      "version": 1,
      "statement": "For smooth strictly positive densities p,q on R^d, q log-concave, H(p|q)<infinity and I=E_p|grad log(p/q)|^2<infinity, compare common-Gaussian-convolution entropy loss with the integral of the squared p-posterior conditional initial relative score. The manuscript also assumes E_p exp(c|Y|^2)<infinity for some c>0. All dimensions d>=1 and times z>0 are quantified.",
