      },
      "natural_statement": "For fixed number N of independent copies and fixed additional precision u, finite adaptive Gaussian observations orthogonal to the difference of the two posterior means lose at most C(N,b,p) u delta relative entropy, with posterior base curvature B=b Id+delta sum(1-P_i), uniformly over mesh subdivisions.",
      "formal_statement": "",
