      "natural_statement": "For the full-observation residuals g_i of the nested-projection minimizer, conditional independence holds across copies even with adaptive exclusions; E|P_i g_i|^2<=N q_N uniformly in the mesh, with q_N=inf_K[K/N+2 E_p(|w|^2 1_{|w|^2>K/2})] tending to zero. The dual comparison error is at most 2uN sqrt(I q_N).",
      "formal_statement": "",
